# Commit attribution

When adding a Co-Authored-By trailer to commits (per CLAUDE.md rule 5), use
**this agent's identity** — not an example agent/model from CLAUDE.md,
AGENTS.md, or another tool.

In Cursor: use Cursor's documented co-author line (e.g.
Co-Authored-By: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>).

Never append a Claude, Copilot, or other product's trailer unless this
session is actually that product. Do not guess model names.
